ef=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> and immunity to Fire damage. \n</p><p><b>Hellfire</b> may also refer to:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Abilities\">Abilities</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a>, the class action used by the Steel Watcher Titan</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Orb\" title=\"Hellfire Orb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/38px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/50px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Orb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Orb\" title=\"Hellfire Orb\">Hellfire Orb</a>, level 6 evocation spell used by That Which Guards, and Stalker Svignee</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Curse\" title=\"Hellfire Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Curse\" title=\"Hellfire Curse\">Hellfire Curse</a>, the level 1 spell used by the Steel Watcher Titan</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Watcher\" title=\"Hellfire Watcher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png/38px-Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png/50px-Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Watcher\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Portrait_Hellfire_Watcher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_